      "text": "30 December، 2023\n\nDamascus, SANA-An Israeli aerial act of aggression on several points south of Aleppo City has caused material losses.\n\n“At about 17:20 p.m. on Saturday, the Israeli enemy carried out an aerial act of aggression from the direction of the Mediterranean Sea, west of Lattakia, targeting a number of points south of Aleppo City,” a military source said in a statement to SANA.\n\nThe source added that the aggression caused some material losses.\n\nHybah/Mhamad\n\ntweet"
    }
